  "outcome": "partial",
  "summary": "Amend the DnD transfer consolidation design after two Codex cross-model reviews, superseding 2026-10-01-dnd-transfer-consolidation-design. The action is the transfer() plugin's move and copy, a dependency of react() and installed explicitly on headless editors. The move check is an interval and reachable-root guard at registerEditorTransactionGuard. Vetoes are a plugin point that always runs. The landing reads, vetoes and List, ColumnItem, TableRow and Upload rules ship in phase 1 with the action, so no private policy port exists. Phase 2 is the non-drag move; phase 3 replaces React DnD with native block drag behind a Benchmark gate. Codex's seven direct plan repairs are kept. Build waits for review confirmation and the user's go.",
  "proof": {
    "state": "partial",
    "evidence": [
      {
