        "claim": "Challenged target, transfer law, landing policy, removed nouns, three adoption phases with failing-first tests, gates and open findings."
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/research/probes/2026-10-01-dnd-transfer/substrate.result.txt",
        "sha256": "7809c260bf055135c4d1ad40187b052c07bd82e6d9bf89dc9327487d192bdc44",
        "claim": "Fourteen measured Plite behaviors (T1-T14) the design rests on, from one run of substrate.probe.ts under bun with plite source aliases."
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/research/probes/2026-10-01-dnd-transfer/review-record.md",
        "sha256": "0809e3ec35a7ad6f5a3204228e08f2e33bace4cbd5bd1f66445b7950a1258c84",
        "claim": "Arena scores, every interrogate finding with its disposition, and the trail review outcome."
      }
    ],
    "limits": "Design only: no product code changed for this plan and no phase ran. The arena, interrogate and trail reviewers were Opus, the author's model family; two Codex reviews ran, and the second's two blockers are applied but not yet confirmed. Probe results come from one bun run, not browser or device proof. The move guard rests on T14 and the plugin publication rule on source reading; neither is built."
  },
